settled Matthias 2026-11-07: the Holt and Benteen 1848 editions differ in rhythm in bar 13 (A B4:2 D5:2 D5:2 E5:2, B B4:2 D5:2 D5:3 E5:1), bar 15 (A B4:2 B4:2 A4:2 A4:2, B B4:1 B4:3 A4:3 A4:1) and bar 22 (A D5:2 B4:2 G4:3 A4:1, B D5:2 B4:2 G4:2 A4:2); Zitro plays the old print's version (Holt), and a second reading of A's scan confirmed A.
